          "heading": "Key rules",
          "list": [
            "I have got a + health problem.",
            "I feel + adjective for emotions.",
            "Should + verb for advice. Shouldn't for negative advice.",
            "-ed adjectives describe how you feel (bored, excited).",
            "-ing adjectives describe what causes the feeling (boring, exciting)."
          ]
        },
        {
          "heading": "Common mistakes",
          "list": [
            "Do not say 'I have pain in the head'. Say 'I have got a headache'.",
            "Do not say 'I am boring'. Say 'I am bored'.",
            "Do not confuse 'should' (advice) with 'must' (obligation)."
          ]
        },
